{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:43 2026-06-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:43 2026-06-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:43 2026-06-18 HKT</p><p>天文台於今日（18日）中午12時10分發出紅色暴雨警告，滂沱大雨下，本港多處地方水浸，元朗、天水圍、屯門虎地、屏廈路、洪水橋及打鼓嶺等地淪為澤國。<br/>社交平台有網民上載各區水浸的情況，當中粉錦公路嚴重水浸，如同澤國，水位上升至車胎的高度。另外，屯門山景邨景貴樓遊樂場亦有水浸，有網民懷疑山上晨運徑有山泥傾瀉，渠口淤塞引致。</p><img alt=\"元朗大坑渠水位高漲。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c1d24c7e5c6e2052c265c607bb18027/2026-06/01_1_34.jpg\"/><img alt=\"屯門有消防車被困水中。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3029e95273fadb9ca23270a6a6270ffe/2026-06/02_34.jpg\"/><img alt=\"本港多處出現水浸。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44157e0f437a5cb82d292859173d96d4/2026-06/03_3_24.jpg\"/><img alt=\"屯門多處水浸。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca12c082e940631d458f13f67b078697/2026-06/04_3_30.jpg\"/><img alt=\"粉嶺高爾夫球場嚴重水浸。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f29d6206dfb9ec64664aa81cc0d2cc2c/2026-06/101_4.jpg\"/><img alt=\"粉嶺高爾夫球場嚴重水浸。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70a768f037226d1a18d1edcbd393ae82/2026-06/102_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"屯門亦園路有汽車被困。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ab15dd7807413790695529cd6767bb8/2026-06/888_37.jpg\"/><img alt=\"76k巴士經過博文橋底時水浸。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a97bf48ffdf4e9cc00959dbe7644701/2026-06/93290327-1e87-45e3-b444-43da57700e55.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b19fbfb3868a2fa186e91b998a2d6de/2026-06/726295179_2060493097888192_3006778872994883784_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"山景邨嚴重水浸。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f76bfa81fca37ffac00bc641654dda9/2026-06/726576414_2039108429975711_2772309064303491274_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"山景邨嚴重水浸。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/924ce997b27d8720315e1dcc88dad957/2026-06/727205786_1661852889279164_8818726995650370119_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"山景邨嚴重水浸。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c02edd0d4a7db7c624f6927613defb0/2026-06/727268518_1700070554649915_4378137920686486688_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"粉錦公路安圃村路口嚴重水浸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/daa0cb052c9041b007a9598938b597f3/2026-06/b5620a7c-87f2-4f8e-a15d-0c3e55a225ff.jpg\"/><img alt=\"天水圍到天慈個邊馬路嚴重水浸。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/566320d01cfe6d629842c4210b1be2bc/2026-06/21_16.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b34a7e39a9413fbe5b02871af95616d4/2026-06/22_16.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-18T06:22:10.861399+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}